  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "15700444",
      "title": "Alternative: Using the Context API",
      "sourceHash": "ce2798993762e050b72743b405e802eea8afa70e36ee5b77d32f422571aefaf4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.125,
          "end": 4.31,
          "en": "Instructor] So lets start with approach number one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.31,
          "end": 6.46,
          "en": "An approach that is sometimes the right choice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.46,
          "end": 7.72,
          "en": "but not always.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.72,
          "end": 10.97,
          "en": "In this approach we'll use the context API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.97,
          "end": 13.28,
          "en": "For this, I'll add a new folder to this project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.28,
          "end": 14.46,
          "en": "and I'll name it context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.46,
          "end": 16.53,
          "en": "but you can of course name this whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.53,
          "end": 19.42,
          "en": "You can manage this wherever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.42,
          "end": 22.23,
          "en": "In this context folder I'll create a new file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.23,
          "end": 25.63,
          "en": "and I'll name it products-context.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.63,
          "end": 27.153,
          "en": "again this name is all up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.153,
          "end": 29.8,
          "en": "And I'll import React from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 29.8,
          "end": 32.23,
          "en": "And then in here we can create our,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 32.23,
          "end": 33.87,
          "en": "let's say products context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 33.87,
          "end": 35.47,
          "en": "Or whatever you want to name it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 36.41,
          "end": 38.57,
          "en": "And I'll actually give this a capital P",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 38.57,
          "end": 40.961,
          "en": "because we'll use that as a component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 40.961,
          "end": 44.21,
          "en": "And then here we use React.createContext,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 44.21,
          "end": 46.016,
          "en": "and well create our context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 46.016,
          "end": 48.37,
          "en": "which should actually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.37,
          "end": 49.82,
          "en": "let's us say manage an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 49.82,
          "end": 52.15,
          "en": "with a products property in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 52.15,
          "end": 54.14,
          "en": "which holds an array of products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 54.14,
          "end": 55.21,
          "en": "And you could also argue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 55.21,
          "end": 58.21,
          "en": "that you're entire context value is just an array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 58.21,
          "end": 60.07,
          "en": "but in case you had other fields too,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 60.07,
          "end": 62.44,
          "en": "you would probably have an object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 62.44,
          "end": 64.68299999999999,
          "en": "So, we have our products here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 68.83,
          "en": "And my initial products here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 68.83,
          "end": 70.76,
          "en": "Our initial products I also have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 70.76,
          "end": 72.6,
          "en": "in the reducers file here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 72.6,
          "end": 74.53999999999999,
          "en": "So its this array of product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 74.53999999999999,
          "end": 76.32,
          "en": "I'll just copy that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 76.32,
          "end": 79.13,
          "en": "Move that in the ProductsContext file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 79.13,
          "end": 81.53,
          "en": "and then simply well replace this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 81.53,
          "end": 82.85300000000001,
          "en": "with this copied array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 83.93,
          "end": 88.487,
          "en": "And with that we're creating a React Context object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 88.487,
          "end": 91.923,
          "en": "And there is one square bracket too much.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 93.58,
          "end": 96.03999999999999,
          "en": "Now this is the context object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 96.03999999999999,
          "end": 97.9,
          "en": "Now here in this file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 97.9,
          "end": 100.62,
          "en": "I want to export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 100.62,
          "end": 102.03,
          "en": "this context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 102.03,
          "end": 107,
          "en": "but I also want to export a component as a default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 107,
          "end": 112,
          "en": "Which gets some props of course and has return some jsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 112.1,
          "end": 115.5,
          "en": "So I'm just exporting a normal functional component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 115.5,
          "end": 117.03,
          "en": "This is a functional component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 117.03,
          "end": 121.53,
          "en": "And there I use my ProductsContext.Provider component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 121.53,
          "end": 124.17,
          "en": "And again check out my Context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 124.17,
          "end": 126.52,
          "en": "my React Context lectures in this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 126.52,
          "end": 128.49,
          "en": "in case this doesn't tell you anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 128.49,
          "end": 132.12,
          "en": "I cover it in the components deep dive section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 132.12,
          "end": 134.13,
          "en": "and I also have a look at it again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 134.13,
          "end": 135.71,
          "en": "in the React hooks section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 135.71,
          "end": 137.95,
          "en": "when we cover the useContext hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 137.95,
          "end": 140.89,
          "en": "So, here I provide my context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 140.89,
          "end": 143.07999999999998,
          "en": "and I want to provide it to everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 143.07999999999998,
          "end": 144.41,
          "en": "that's passed between the opening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 144.41,
          "end": 146.97,
          "en": "and closing text of my exported component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 146.97,
          "end": 149.3,
          "en": "here with props.children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 149.3,
          "end": 150.35,
          "en": "Now important though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 150.35,
          "end": 153.29,
          "en": "the value of this context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 153.29,
          "end": 156.41,
          "en": "should be a value which I manage in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 156.41,
          "end": 159.18,
          "en": "So, since that should be able to change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 159.18,
          "end": 161.9,
          "en": "I'll use the useState hook which is baked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 161.9,
          "end": 165.23,
          "en": "into React to work with functional components only.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 165.23,
          "end": 167.07,
          "en": "Though theoretically that could all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 167.07,
          "end": 168.44,
          "en": "be a class based component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 168.44,
          "end": 170.25,
          "en": "that would be fine too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 170.25,
          "end": 174.15,
          "en": "And then here I want to manage my state here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 174.15,
          "end": 176.63,
          "en": "Now, my state I managed here in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 176.63,
          "end": 178.54,
          "en": "will be that array of products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 178.54,
          "end": 179.433,
          "en": "So actually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 180.33,
          "end": 182.93,
          "en": "I'll grab that array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 182.93,
          "end": 183.86,
          "en": "remove it from there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 183.86,
          "end": 185.52,
          "en": "and here simply initialize an empty array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 185.52,
          "end": 188.36,
          "en": "to get batter auto completion and ive support.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 188.36,
          "end": 189.84,
          "en": "But the value here doesn't matter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 189.84,
          "end": 192.97,
          "en": "because we'll now manage the products here in this State.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 192.97,
          "end": 195.2,
          "en": "So that will now just be an array not an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 195.2,
          "end": 197.56,
          "en": "Just be an array of products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 197.56,
          "end": 200.02,
          "en": "Make sure the square brackets are correct.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 200.02,
          "end": 205.02,
          "en": "And here we'll have our products and a setProducts function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 205.07,
          "end": 206.99,
          "en": "which we extract from useState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 206.99,
          "end": 211.75,
          "en": "And now here the value I pass to my provider,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 211.75,
          "end": 213.28,
          "en": "to my products context provider",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 213.28,
          "end": 215.99,
          "en": "is a object with the products key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 215.99,
          "end": 217.82,
          "en": "because I want to have that in my context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 217.82,
          "end": 220.26,
          "en": "that's just my personal preference here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 220.26,
          "end": 223.42000000000002,
          "en": "And the value for that products key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 223.42000000000002,
          "end": 225.6,
          "en": "will be my products list here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 225.6,
          "end": 228.2,
          "en": "And I'll actually name this productsList,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 228.2,
          "end": 230.5,
          "en": "and name it here productsList when we extract it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 230.5,
          "end": 234.06,
          "en": "So that we have no confusion regarding what's what.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 234.06,
          "end": 236.5,
          "en": "So here I manage an array of products",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 236.5,
          "end": 239.15,
          "en": "with useState, it's named productsList,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 239.15,
          "end": 241.75,
          "en": "and I assign this to my products key here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 241.75,
          "end": 243.92,
          "en": "in that object I pass as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 243.92,
          "end": 246.49,
          "en": "to my ProductsContext.Provider.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 246.49,
          "end": 249.09,
          "en": "So now whenever this value here changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 249.09,
          "end": 250.607,
          "en": "whenever we update the state here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 250.607,
          "end": 252.03,
          "en": "and therefore this component rebuilds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 252.03,
          "end": 255.83,
          "en": "Whenever that happens our provider will get a new value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 255.83,
          "end": 258.95,
          "en": "and every child that listens to our provider,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 258.95,
          "end": 261.593,
          "en": "will be able to get that new value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 264.09,
          "end": 265.72,
          "en": "Now with that prepared,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 265.72,
          "end": 268.77,
          "en": "we can use our provider here in index.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 268.77,
          "end": 272.15999999999997,
          "en": "where I previously provided react-redux.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 272.15999999999997,
          "end": 273.53,
          "en": "I'll not do that anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 273.53,
          "end": 276.31,
          "en": "and hence I can get rid of these two imports.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 276.31,
          "end": 277.34000000000003,
          "en": "And instead here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 277.34000000000003,
          "end": 282.34000000000003,
          "en": "I want to import my ProductsProvider from context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 283.5,
          "end": 286.93,
          "en": "whoops, context, products-context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 286.93,
          "end": 288.40999999999997,
          "en": "That's our default export there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 288.40999999999997,
          "end": 290.7,
          "en": "so we import it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 290.7,
          "end": 292.963,
          "en": "Get rid of all that here, we don't need that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 293.86,
          "end": 296.27,
          "en": "And then here have our ProductsProvider opening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 296.27,
          "end": 298.79,
          "en": "and closing we don't need to pass anything to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 298.79,
          "end": 300.15,
          "en": "We just use it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 300.15,
          "end": 302.32,
          "en": "We can always get rid of the productReducer import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 302.32,
          "end": 304.33,
          "en": "You could also delete the entire store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 304.33,
          "end": 306.26,
          "en": "fold her now if you wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 306.26,
          "end": 307.8,
          "en": "I'll leave it here for reference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 307.8,
          "end": 309.66,
          "en": "So now I'm providing my context here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 309.66,
          "end": 311.45,
          "en": "and anywhere in this component tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 311.45,
          "end": 313.09,
          "en": "So in any child component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 313.09,
          "end": 314.3,
          "en": "or in a child component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 314.3,
          "end": 315.514,
          "en": "off that component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 315.514,
          "end": 318.623,
          "en": "I can kind of listen to that context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 320.21,
          "end": 322.09,
          "en": "Now one place where I'm interested in product,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 322.09,
          "end": 323.43,
          "en": "is the Products.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 323.43,
          "end": 325.373,
          "en": "in the containers folder for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 326.67,
          "end": 329.12,
          "en": "There we can add an import statement,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 329.12,
          "end": 331.95,
          "en": "to import something from our context folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 331.95,
          "end": 333.73,
          "en": "and there from products-context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 333.73,
          "end": 336.77,
          "en": "And the something here is now not the provider component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 336.77,
          "end": 339.61,
          "en": "but the productsContext object itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
